SystemFlight --> BattlePhase : phase
SpaceUnit "*" --> "0..1" Ship : ship
SpaceUnit "*" --> "0..1" ShipDesign : design
SpaceUnit "1" *-- "0..1" ShipDamage : damage
Ship "1" *-- "0..1" ShipDamage : damage
ShipDamage --> HitZone
SpaceUnit --> Intent
LogEntry <|-- SpaceBattle
LogEntry <|-- SpaceAttack
LogEntry <|-- SpaceBattleEnd
SpaceBattle "*" --> "1" ShipDesign : design
SpaceAttack "*" --> "1" ShipWeapon : weapon
SpaceAttack "*" --> "0..1" Character : gunner
LogEntry <|-- DamageControl
DamageControl --> HitZone
DamageControl "*" --> "0..1" Character : by
SpaceAttack --> HitZone
SpaceBattleEnd --> BattleOutcome
SpaceBattle --> EncounterOccasion
SpaceBattle "*" --> "0..1" Hex : jumpTo
SpaceBattle "*" --> "0..1" World : travelTo
SystemFlight "*" --> "0..1" SpaceBattle : departure
EncounterCheck "0..1" --> "0..1" SpaceBattle : sighting
EncounterCheck --> EncounterOccasion
EncounterCheck "*" --> "0..1" Hex : jumpTo
EncounterCheck "*" --> "0..1" World : travelTo
SystemFlight "*" --> "1" SpaceUnit : party
SpaceUnit "1" *-- "*" TrackPoint : track {ordered}
LogEntry <|-- Skimming
Skimming "*" --> "1" World : at
Skimming "*" --> "1" Ship : ship
Hex "1" *-- "0..1" StarSystem : system
StarSystem "1" *-- "1..3" Star : stars {ordered}
Star "*" --> "1" StarZones : /zones
Star --> StarType
Star --> StarSize

